WEBVTT

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.990
September, 771, New Holy Era

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.100
Huh?!

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.150
How can this be?!

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:21.770
Nonnoria, is something the matter?

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.900
Alfred...

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.900
There aren't nearly enough of
the medicinal herbs I ordered.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.560
I had to scrape this together as it is.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.350
Why just the medicinal herbs?

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.480
The rumor is that Cocon Village
has turned into a ghost town.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.150
Hmm? Did you say Cocon Village?

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.560
You know it?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.940
They carried on trade with
my village once upon a time.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:47.270
The place must supply over half
the medicinal herbs for Hortensia.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.900
It wouldn't suddenly become a ghost town.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.270
Whatever the case, they're hard to come by now.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.770
And the price has soared.

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:58.150
This is going to disrupt the lives of my people.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:02.440
I'll arrange for the funds to buy them.
Can I ask for your help...

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.730
...to make sure the people
of Albert are not put out?

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:07.270
Aw, you're killing me.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.730
Well, the lords of Albert have been
good to me for two generations.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:13.940
I'll see what I can do.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.560
Thank you very much.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:16.900
Thank goodness!

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.150
<i>Moru!</i>

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:19.690
Thank you so much.

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:23.400
That's Fernando's son for you!

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.850
Cocon Village, eh?

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:28.020
I smell a rat.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.690
It turns out this is all we could buy <i>moru</i> .

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:11.020
What do we do?
This much will run out in no time.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:15.150
What if Alfred and the others get really hurt?

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.940
Hey, don't mind me.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.100
Deflotte...

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.520
What's up <i>moru</i> ?

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.400
Just popping over to Cocon Village.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.440
Huh?

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.600
But I thought the village was deserted.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.600
Those are just rumors, right?
I'm going to go check it out,

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.020
and buy you some medicinal herbs
while I'm there.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.600
I'll come with you.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.810
Hey now...

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:36.350
Having a lord along will make business
move forward much quicker.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.900
Then I'll come, too...

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:38.810
No, you don't have to come.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:43.560
It's for my people. Besides,
I'm concerned about Cocon Village.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:47.770
It's too weird that a whole village
would suddenly be deserted.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:49.650
For heaven's sake...

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.060
I would like to accompany you, as well, Alfred!

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:55.020
Nonnoria?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.770
Thanks, Nonnoria, but this will be a long trip,

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.060
and it would be awful if you got hurt.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:04.480
But... But... But...

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.900
Okay, Maurice, hold things down here for me.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.060
Sure, I'm on it.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:18.190
Come back safely. Please be careful.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.440
Maurice...

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.900
I have a favor to ask!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.730
Cocon Village has a rich water supply,

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.100
so they can grow all sorts of medicinal herbs.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.690
Because of that, their medical skills
are well developed,

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.770
and there are many sick from
all over Hortensia who visit there.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:52.150
If the rumors are true,
this won't be a problem for just Albert.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.270
It looks like there's gonna be
a big problem here, in another sense.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.770
What is going on?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:03.400
Just turn around.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.350
Ecclesiastical Knights?

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:08.810
Cocon Village has been deserted due to flooding.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:12.350
The way ahead is dangerous, so you may not pass.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.810
Then where will I go for medicinal herbs?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.650
You'll have to go without.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.310
Oh, no...

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.810
Flooding, he says?

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.560
That's a huge deal <i>moru</i> .

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.730
I don't believe that.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:30.770
This way.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.440
You know a way in?

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.650
I told you we traded with them, remember?

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:38.060
There are any number of
shortcuts into Cocon Village.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.480
Hey, are you sure about this?

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.730
Don't worry about it.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:49.660
Oh, please...

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.900
<i>Moru</i> ...

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.190
There, see? I was right.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.150
That is Cocon Village.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.560
There's no flooding here <i>moru</i> .

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.440
I thought as much.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:16.230
Hey, mister, do you have a moment?

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.150
Who are you?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.850
Did you come from outside the village?

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:22.900
Yeah.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.730
We heard a rumor that the village
was deserted, so we came to see.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.810
Is <i>that</i> what they say?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:32.190
By any chance, is the Orthodox Church involved?

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:35.440
Yeah. As it happens...

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.770
About two years ago,

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:43.520
some Ecclesiastical Knights showed up
in the village out of the blue.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:46.310
They said that they were placing
the village and the hospital

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.480
under Orthodox Church control.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.480
They set up a checkpoint
at the village's entrance,

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:55.600
then finally ended up
locking everything down entirely.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:07:00.810
Those Orthodox Church jerks!
What exactly are they doing in this village?

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.980
Well...

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.060
Hold up.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:08.060
Best not to say anything out of turn.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:13.400
For what reason are you here asking about
the Orthodox Church's business?

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:17.650
Ha! What are you, an Orthodox Church's dog,
cracking down on the villagers?

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:21.650
Ho, you would defy the Orthodox Church?

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:23.310
Interesting.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.190
Don't.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.400
There's no cause for alarm.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:32.770
I'm Adel, a former priest.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:34.850
<i>Former</i> priest?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.810
I've lost any right to serve God,

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.190
and have broken away from the Orthodox Church.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:44.560
You're not just saying that
to try to trick us, are you?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.270
I once served as a priest,

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:51.020
and was sent to Petale Village,
where the petridermic plague was rampant.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.690
But I was terrified by the tragedy
of the petridermic plague,

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:58.150
forsook the villagers there, and fled.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:03.350
Since that time, I have been
a complete and utter sinner.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:07.270
So I am here to atone for my sin.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:13.310
I'll tell you exactly what the Orthodox Church
is doing in this village.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.650
Come with me.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:30.310
Tell me, have you ever met
the priest from Petale Village?

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.480
Do you mean Father Danois?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:40.350
Father Danois was a pillar of support
to those who lived in terror of the plague.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:45.270
His faith was strong, too.
He was the model of what a priest should be.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.810
I see.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:55.060
Perhaps our meeting like this was no accident.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.770
Look there.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.480
Gnoll Hospital.

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:05.100
It's the hospital that the Orthodox Church
placed under their control.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.690
It looks like their security is pretty tight.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.310
What are they doing there?

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:13.900
They probably have petridermic patients
committed there, even now.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:14.770
What?!

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:15.730
Impossible!

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.650
I thought the petridermic plague
had been eradicated!

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.440
The plague had outbreaks in places
other than Petale Village, too.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.480
But at some point, the rumors
about the sickness died down,

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.480
and the afflicted went missing.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.650
I haven't heard of a single case
where any of them ever recovered.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:34.310
Are you saying that those afflicted
are being kept in there?

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.480
No doubt about it.

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.650
It's in order to cover up the disease,
and keep it contained,

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.100
and I also fear that
the doctors in that hospital

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.270
are using those people to
conduct human experimentation.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.100
That can't be!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:52.770
It is impossible for me to
liberate the patients by myself.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:56.100
I would appreciate your help.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:57.350
Of course.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.100
What do we do?

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:01.600
There's a channel that leads
to the hospital's basement.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.150
All right, let's head there right now!

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.980
Just a moment.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.100
What is it, Alfred?

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:12.270
We should report this to Captain Georg first.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.150
Huh? Is this any time for that?

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:19.270
At this very minute, people could be
having their lives taken from them!

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:22.940
We can't overlook
what's happening in this village,

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:26.020
nor can we ignore those who
are suffering from the plague.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:26.980
But...

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.060
What is there to consider?!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:33.100
You know how much power the Orthodox Church has.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:35.310
Lord Albert...

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:41.940
...you know full well what it would mean
to draw your sword, don't you?

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.650
Don't tell me you're afraid
of the Orthodox Church.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:49.560
You disappoint me, Alfred.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.310
Let's go, Adel.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:52.480
Are you sure?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.520
Yeah.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:11:00.650
Come on! We can't let the Orthodox Church
get away with this atrocity!

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:30.150
It's so dark and damp in here,

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:33.060
it feels like something
might jump out at us <i>moru</i> .

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.730
Wah! What was that <i>moru</i> ?!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.310
Ouch...

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:41.400
I'm sorry <i>moru</i> .

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.520
Are you okay, Marius?

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.810
Y-Yeah.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.480
Honestly, you are a handful.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.310
Spell it out for him so he can understand.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:59.020
You're not simply afraid of turning
the Orthodox Church against you, right?

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:08.690
Marius, you are right.
I <i>do</i> fear the Orthodox Church.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:15.400
Do you know what would happen
if a territorial lord was arrested as a rebel?

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.940
Huh?

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.770
I would be stripped of all my property,
including my territory,

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:22.600
and the people would be
placed under their control.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:29.230
The Ecclesiastical Order would be likely
to oppress and scourge the people without mercy.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:33.350
That's why it's no easy matter
for me to go against them.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:37.980
But seeing this village, and everything else
the Orthodox Church has done,

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.150
the miserable state of the kingdom
is giving me second thoughts.

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.060
Where is the justice?

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:46.230
What should I have done?

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.900
Sorry. Let's keep moving forward.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:00.230
Alfred has been acting as a lord,

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:04.150
restraining himself in order
to protect his people.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.150
Then what am <i>I</i> doing?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.600
That's where the hospital
draws water from the channel.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.020
There shouldn't be anyone there at this hour.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:23.400
This is perfect time for a ghost to appear <i>moru</i> .

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.060
What are you so spooked about?

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.850
Something scary, like undead,
might jump out <i>moru</i> !

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.940
Don't be ridiculous, <i>moru</i> -guy!

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.440
There's no way anything would turn up here...

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:34.500
They really did <i>moru</i> !

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.690
Why are there undead here?!

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:37.650
So they weren't just in Petale Village?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.650
Let's go!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:48.940
Tch, these are tough customers!

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:52.020
These folks aren't from Petale Village.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.520
Deflotte, what's the matter?!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.060
Is everyone all right?

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:10.900
Yeah. But why were there undead here?

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:14.650
These monsters were never here before.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:17.440
Are you okay? You look a little pale.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.230
What are you talking about? Let's hurry along.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:38.310
They're probably being held in there.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:39.230
Let's go.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.310
Right.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.560
Voices?

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.900
In here!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.400
No doubt about it. These are
petridermic plague patients.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:25.480
How can they confine the sick
down in a basement like this?!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.230
It's like they're just waiting for death.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.940
Isn't there anyone here from Petale Village?

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.400
Someone's coming!

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.600
This is plenty of proof. Let's withdraw for now.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.600
Yeah.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:15:59.270
Hurry!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.690
Deflotte!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.600
Oh, no!

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.810
Who is that guy?

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:15.060
Damn...

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.190
This guy is huge.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:22.400
So this is our intruder, is it?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:27.850
Honestly, these filthy rats
will sneak in from anywhere.

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:31.690
Doctor Graff. He's the hospital's doctor.

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:36.400
I was just growing tired of dealing with
those who were nearly dead.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:41.980
Gaston, have some fun with him.
Just make sure not to kill him.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.770
What's the story with this guy?
Didn't that hurt him?

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:02.270
That one must be an experiment
in physical modification.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:06.150
What the hell are you doing
to the petridermic patients here?!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.770
Treating them.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:14.350
I'm giving them drugs
so they don't feel pain or suffering.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:19.520
When a body feels no pain, I can do
whatever experiments I want to on it,

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:25.440
but for people who are so close to dying,
they sure do scream about everything.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.600
You're the worst kind of corrupt lowlife.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:32.190
What are you talking about?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:36.690
I'm carrying out my treatment
under the pope's orders.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:38.100
The pope?

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.480
You idiot!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.690
You guys keep going and get out of here!

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.230
What are you planning to do?!

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:52.850
It looks like fate has somehow
brought me to this. I can't just ignore it.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:54.440
You can't do it alone!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:57.980
Let someone who isn't shouldering
other responsibilities handle this.

00:17:57.980 --> 00:17:58.800
Dr. Graff!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:03.100
What if one of them recognizes you?

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:00.850
Where is the intruder?

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:03.100
Oh, just wait.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.810
You can't afford to be caught.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.980
You have to protect Albert, right?

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.690
Deflotte...

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.020
Alfred!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.190
Marius!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.850
What are you doing?!

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.810
Alfred will not abandon you.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:32.150
But he has to protect Albert. Which means,

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:36.980
as his page, it's my duty to carry out
my lord's wishes in his place!

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:41.440
They keep coming, they keep coming!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.400
This will speed my experiments along!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.230
Marius!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.650
What are you doing <i>moru</i> ?!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.270
I'm sorry, Qoo, but you're
getting out of here with Adel.

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.980
You then have to inform the others.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:02.690
You must go in my place.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.270
I've learned something for myself.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.770
From the plight of this village...

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:18.060
...and all of the other actions
the Orthodox Church has taken...

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:21.350
...I've learned that simply
protecting Albert is not enough.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:24.650
I have to protect both Albert and my friends!

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:28.190
That is, as lord of Albert...

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:31.060
...and as the son of Sir Fernando...

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.730
...my just cause!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.270
Are you sure about this, Alfred?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.150
You are one hell of a territorial lord.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.690
It doesn't matter how many
of you rats there are!

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.900
Gaston, get them!

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:09.810
No, my Gaston...!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:13.020
By Albert's name,
you will make public the atrocities

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.350
committed by the Orthodox Church
on these petridermic sufferers.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.230
Sir Didier!

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.190
When did he get here?!

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.770
What in the world are you doing
in a place like this,

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:28.150
lord of Albert?

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:30.690
What are <i>you</i> doing here, sir?

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:33.690
Why, giving aid to those
who are suffering from disease,

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:37.020
as a result of their sins, of course.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.560
You call this aid?!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:41.150
Who would believe a lie like that?!

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:45.020
It was all Pope Vall d'Hebron's idea.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:48.020
Then until I can ask the pope himself,

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:51.020
Didier, you are my prisoner!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.230
If you had just minded your own business
on the land you were given,

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:57.690
you could have lived out your life
in peace and safety.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.400
You poor fool!

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:04.860
Damn you!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.480
Why do you cast away your security,

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:12.940
and stray from the path to
the peaceful future you are promised?

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.690
Deflotte... Marius...

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.730
Indeed, so that is the story...

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.600
You posed as a man to fool those around you,

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.900
and that is how you managed to survive.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.730
Stop... Didier...

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.400
I have caught you at last.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:41.310
This woman is the petridermic plague witch.

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.310
That's absurd!

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:47.850
Seize those two. They are criminals
who are in league with the witch.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:52.270
Wait! Hold up!

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:56.440
Marius!

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.050
Chapter 7

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.050
Dilemma

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.050
~A Truth Revealed~

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:36.900
I swore to protect my friends--
to protect everything!

00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:38.650
The witch is to be executed.

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:42.060
Now, no one else will have to
get hurt because of me.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:43.400
It can't end like this!

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:46.850
Farewell, Alfred.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Chapter 8

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Lamplight

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.030
~The Return of the Princess~
